+    /// The specialization constant answering `air.is_null_texture` for Metal texture argument
+    /// `metal_index`: an `OpSpecConstantFalse` decorated `SpecId NULL_TEXTURE_SPEC_ID_BASE +
+    /// metal_index`, created once per argument. False unspecialized, because an unspecialized
